				<section id="mariya" class="staff">
					<div class="full-height">
						<h2>Mariya Grinina</h2>
						<h3>Co-founder & CEO</h3>
						<p>Mariya’s background in journalism enabled her to meet with inspiring people often from the fashion world and have exposure to fascinating stories. It was through these intriguing experiences that Mariya developed an avid interest in bringing about a positive change.</p> 
						<p>She was inspired by her best friend’s idea, who having experienced at first hand numerous inefficiencies in the workings of the modelling industry, wanted to streamline the model booking process. Mariya was also inspired by her friend’s life story: Alina Isachenka’s successful modelling career enabled her to travel and earn money to eventually pursue her true dream career of becoming a TV journalist. Mariya and Alina co-founded Finda together, before Alina left to start her full-time job at BBC.</p>
						<p>Today Mariya is thrilled to launch iDAL with her amazing team members.</p>
					</div>
				</section>
				<section id="tom" class="staff">
					<div class="full-height">
						<h2>Tom Gordon</h2>
						<h3>Co-founder & CTO</h3>
						<p>Tom has over 20 years of development experience across fashion, education, global entertainment and fintech industries.</p> 
						<p>Tom previously worked as Head of Web Development at Elle and Sugarscape Magazines. His career has also seen him working for Motilo, developing a fashion trend forecasting platform called Peclers Plus and receiving a BAFTA and an Emmy award for web development for Channel 4.</p>
						<p>Capitalising on his deep understanding of the fashion industry and fashion trend forecasting, Tom saw iDAL as the perfect opportunity to build and develop something new and very exciting. Tom serves as co-founder and CTO for iDAL and manages the technical development, strategy and implementation for the fashion platform.</p>
					</div> 
				</section>
{*
				<section id="martine" class="staff">
