						<h2>Martine Dyb</h2>
						<h3>Head of Product Development & Model</h3>
						<p>Martine brings to iDAL over 14 years of working experience in the modelling and fashion industries together with a degree in international business and marketing.</p>  
						<p>Upon conclusion of her studies in Oslo, Martine travelled the world as a fashion model, working for some of the world’s most prominent brands such as such as Louis Vuitton, Lanvin and Celine whilst also representing smaller brands.</p> 
						<p>Over the course of her global modelling career, Martine developed a passion to innovate and create. She went on to co-found a multi–brand e-commerce platform called Ynde in Oslo.</p>  
						<p>Aware of the need for evolution and change within the modelling industry, Martine saw iDAL as the perfect place to foster her creative skill set and passion for technology innovation.</p> 
						<p>Martine enriches the iDAL team not only with her broad spectrum of modelling experience but also with her professional business acumen.</p>
					</div> 
