						<h3>Community Manager & Model</h3>
						<p>Leanne is a model, writer and law graduate from Queen Mary University of London.</p> 
						<p>She has over 13 years of experience as a professional model working with some of the industry’s top-tier brands and is also an accomplished author currently publishing her book, 'The Model Manifesto’.</p>
						<p>Leanne strives to improve and connect the lives of iDAL models through a strong community spirit, and by hosting regular events and workshops for models to keep up to date on topics concerning them. Leanne acts as a guide for iDAL models to nurture their growth within this community ensuring that they are able to cultivate and enhance their creativity within a trusted environment.</p> 
